    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d516">

                <pb facs="d515-1" n="1" sameAs="frus:frus1955-57v03mSupp/d515-1"/>

                <head>516. Telegram 1586 from Geneva<anchor n="1" xml:id="d516-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Geneva</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1956-03-03">March 3, 1956, 3
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d516-1" n="1" type="facsimile" xml:id="d516-1"/>
                <p>1586. From Osborn. My telegram sent Department 1585 repeated information Prague
                    26.</p>
                <p>Reporters say Chinese Communist Consulate General has announced postponement
                    release, no indication until then.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">Gowen</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Note: FE Duty Officer notified 3/3/1:15 p.m. LWH</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d516-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d516-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Department of State, Central Files, 611.93/3–356. Official Use Only;
                    Priority. Repeated for information Priority to Prague for the Ambassador as
                    telegram 26.</p>
            </note>
